   <text type="manuscript">
      <body>
         <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="Yale/CD7/Whitman9.jpg" type="recto"/>
         <lg type="poem">
         
            <note type="authorial" place="top" hand="#h02" rend="underline">don't like this head line try again&#8211;</note>

            <head rend="italic" type="main-authorial">With Husky,<add place="below" hand="#h02"><metamark target="#a001" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#a001">/</metamark></add><add hand="#h02" place="above" xml:id="a001">:</add> Haughty Lips, O sea!</head>
   <delSpan rend="overstrike" hand="#h02" spanTo="#d001"/><milestone unit="undeclared" rend="short-center"/><anchor xml:id="d001"/><addSpan hand="#h02" spanTo="#a004"/><metamark function="delete" target="#d001">&#977;</metamark><anchor xml:id="a004"/>

            <l>With husky<del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">,</del><add place="left" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#a002">/</metamark></add><add hand="#h02" place="left" xml:id="a002">:</add> haughty lips, O <subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">s</del><add place="right" seq="2" rend="marked">S</add></subst>ea!<add hand="#h02" place="below"><metamark function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="right" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize">#</metamark></add></l>
            
            <addSpan rend="insertion"
                     place="interlinear"
                     hand="h1"
                     to="a1"/>
            <space dim="vertical" extent="1 line"/>
            <anchor xml:id="a1"/>
            <note type="authorial"
                  hand="h1"
                  place="interlinear">#</note>
            <l>Where day and night I wend thy surf-beat shore,</l>
            <l>Imaging to my sense thy varied strange suggestions<subst>
                  <rdg varSeq="1">
                     <del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">;</del>
                  </rdg>
                  <rdg varSeq="2">
                     <add rend="unmarked" place="right" hand="h1">,</add>
                  </rdg>
               </subst>
            </l>
            <l>Thy troops of white-maned racers racing to the goal,</l>
            <l>
               Thy ample, smiling face, dash'd with the sparkling dimples of<lb/>
               the sun,<lb/>
            </l>
            <l>Thy brooding scowl and murk—thy unloos'd hurricanes,</l>
            <note type="authorial"
                  place="right"
                  rend="circled"
                  hand="h1">
               <p>defeats</p>
            </note>
            <addSpan rend="insertion"
                     place="interlinear"
                     hand="h1"
                     to="a1"/>
            <space dim="vertical" extent="1 line"/>
            <anchor xml:id="a1"/>
            <note type="authorial"
                  hand="h1"
                  place="interlinear">#</note>
            <l>Thy unsubduedness, caprices, wilfulness;</l>
            <l>
               Great as thou art above the rest, thy many tears—a lack<lb/> 
               from all eternity in thy content,<lb/>
            </l>
            <l>
               (Naught but the greatest struggles, wrongs, defe<subst>
                     <rdg varSeq="1">
                        <del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">c</del>
                     </rdg>
                     <rdg varSeq="2">
                        <add rend="unmarked" place="supralinear" hand="h1">a</add>
                     </rdg>
                  </subst>ts, could make<lb/>
               thee greatest—no less could make thee,)<lb/>
            </l>
            <l>
               Thy lonely state—something thou ever seek'st and seek'st, yet<lb/>
               never gain'st,<lb/>
            </l>
            <l>
               Surely some right withheld—some voice<add rend="insertion" place="supralinear" hand="h1">,</add> in huge monotonous<lb/>
               rage<add rend="insertion" place="left" hand="h1">,</add> of freedom-lover<del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">,</del> 
                  <add rend="insertion" place="right" hand="h1">pent</add>,<lb/>
            </l>
            <l>
               Some vast heart, <del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">pent</del> like a planet's, chain'd and chafing in<lb/>
               th<subst>
                     <rdg varSeq="1">
                        <del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">e</del>
                     </rdg>
                     <rdg varSeq="2">
                        <add rend="unmarked" place="left" hand="h1">o</add>
                     </rdg>
                  </subst>se breakers,<lb/>
            </l>
            <l>By lengthen'd swell, and spasm, and panting breath<add rend="insertion" place="right" hand="h1">,</add>
            </l>
            <l>And rhythmic rasping of thy sands and waves,</l>
            <l>And serpent hiss, and savage peals of laughter,</l>
            <l>And undertones of distant lion roar,</l>
            <l>
               (Sounding, appealing to the sky's deaf ear—but now<add rend="insertion" place="right" hand="h1">,</add> rapport<lb/>
               for once,<lb/>
            </l>
            <l>A phantom in the night thy confidant for once,)</l>
            <l>The first and last confession <subst>
                  <rdg varSeq="1">
                     <del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">e</del>
                  </rdg>
                  <rdg varSeq="2">
                     <add rend="unmarked" place="right" hand="h1">o</add>
                  </rdg>
               </subst>f the globe,</l>
            <l>Out<subst>
                  <rdg varSeq="1">
                     <del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">ra</del>
                  </rdg>
                  <rdg varSeq="2">
                     <add rend="unmarked" place="left" hand="h1">sur</add>
                  </rdg>
               </subst>,
<note type="authorial"
                     place="left"
                     rend="circled"
                     hand="h1">outsurging</note>
 muttering<del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">,</del> from thy soul's abysms,</l>
            <l>The tale of cosmic elemental passion,</l>
            <l>Thou t<subst>
                  <rdg varSeq="1">
                     <del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">a</del>
                  </rdg>
                  <rdg varSeq="2">
                     <add rend="unmarked" place="left" hand="h1">e</add>
                  </rdg>
               </subst>llest <subst>
                  <rdg varSeq="1">
                     <del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">of</del>
                  </rdg>
                  <rdg varSeq="2">
                     <add rend="unmarked" place="infralinear" hand="h1">to</add>
                  </rdg>
               </subst> a kindred soul.</l>
         </lg>
         <signed>WALT WHITMAN.</signed>
         <del rend="overstrike" hand="h1">
            <add rend="unmarked" place="inline" hand="h1">—</add>
         </del>
      </body>
